OL,3,AEx-England footballer Raheem Sterling
OL,4,Ato be sentenced for dangerous driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FRaheem Sterling is due to be sentenced
OL,7,Fafter pleading guilty to dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving earlier this year
OL,10,FThe former England footballer, 31, was
OL,11,Farrested after crashing a Lamborghini
OL,12,Fnear the M3 in Hampshire on the morning
OL,13,Fof 28 May - police body-worn footage
OL,14,Fcaptured the moment of his arrest
OL,16,FBasingstoke Magistrates' Court heard he
OL,17,Fstrayed into the central reservation of
OL,18,Fthe motorway, before exiting and
OL,19,Fcrashing into "roadside infrastructure"
OL,20,Fin a layby
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
