OL,3,AEx-England footballer Raheem Sterling
OL,4,Ato be sentenced for dangerous driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne eyewitness told police she saw
OL,7,F"absolutely horrendous driving" as the
OL,8,Fcar swerved in and out of lanes
OL,10,FSterling pleaded guilty to driving the
OL,11,Fcar dangerously on the M3, the M25, the
OL,12,FA327 and Minley Road - he also admitted
OL,13,Fpossessing nitrous oxide, a Class C
OL,14,Fdrug, for wrongful inhalation and
OL,15,Ffailing to provide a specimen for
OL,16,Fanalysis
OL,18,FThe footballer has 82 England caps, the
OL,19,Flast of which was won at the 2022 World
OL,20,FCup in Qatar
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
